Input: real key press/release, WASD, saner mouse.
 - new efi/i_input.c: take USB HID boot keyboards (async interrupt reports)
   and the PS/2 controller (set-1 scancodes) over from the firmware for
   true key-down/key-up events, so held keys respond at once and several
   keys work together; the ConIn fallback holds a key until its repeats
   stop. Firmware drivers are reconnected in I_ShutdownGraphics (called by
   I_Quit and I_Error); -conin skips the takeover.
 - stop force-releasing every key each frame (G_ResetKeycmd in D_DoomLoop)
 - W/A/S/D move and strafe next to the arrows and , .
 - mouse: raw counts scaled by the reported resolution relative to edk2s
   nominal 8 and never above raw counts (was counts x4); -mousescale
   <percent>; vertical mouse movement only with -vertmouse

